{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave, been a few days, so I wanted to let you in on some cool news. I just got a new car and it's amazing! Finally owning a luxury car was a dream come true and I'm so stoked."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-9a38ac26af33bd5be04d1ae0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.377527+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a38ac26af33bd5be04d1ae0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a38ac26af33bd5be04d1ae0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Woohoo, Calvin! Congrats on the new car! How's it driving?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-5b3ea36a65931e15b42abeec", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.400099+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5b3ea36a65931e15b42abeec", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5b3ea36a65931e15b42abeec", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Nice car! It's an amazing ride - super smooth and real powerful. Like a rockstar behind the wheel! Thanks, man!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-b41719e75e61a60930f85271", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.414678+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b41719e75e61a60930f85271", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b41719e75e61a60930f85271", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin! Owning something like this must feel amazing. Is this your first one? Show me a pic! What's it called?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-3c0f7680fc1f0abef5c07b83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.427681+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c0f7680fc1f0abef5c07b83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c0f7680fc1f0abef5c07b83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Woohoo! I finally got myself this beauty. Here's a pic from yesterday when I took it for a ride. Can't believe I'm actually driving it. Definitely what I deserve after all this hard work. Every time I step in, it's like an adrenaline rush!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-a344cc0c6c1719b84eab7ad6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.439235+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a344cc0c6c1719b84eab7ad6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a344cc0c6c1719b84eab7ad6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Calvin, that car looks awesome! You must feel amazing every time you get inside! You deserved it - congrats buddy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-da3f2893acc36e0f746f9cf7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.454978+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da3f2893acc36e0f746f9cf7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da3f2893acc36e0f746f9cf7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Woah, I'm on cloud nine! Hard work pays off. What's up with you, Dave?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-49dd353fb7c7d87b9c5f0771", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.471081+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49dd353fb7c7d87b9c5f0771", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49dd353fb7c7d87b9c5f0771", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Doing good. Last weekend, I went to a music festival in Boston - it was awesome! So many cool bands playing and the atmosphere was electric. I love music, it reminded me why I love it. Here's a pic, take a look."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-69b1fe8b87983bf30712a39e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.482955+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "69b1fe8b87983bf30712a39e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "69b1fe8b87983bf30712a39e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, sounds like a blast! Which one was your favorite?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-2f80a700f32b996df7d2c1ac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.500177+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2f80a700f32b996df7d2c1ac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2f80a700f32b996df7d2c1ac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, there were so many great bands! If I had to pick a favorite, it would definitely be Aerosmith. Their performance was incredible. I'll show you a pic I took when they were playing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-175121cc36e35289fbc328e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.511399+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "175121cc36e35289fbc328e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "175121cc36e35289fbc328e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Cool! Lovin' Aerosmith."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-59bbcaf78a20b87412557089", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.526085+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "59bbcaf78a20b87412557089", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "59bbcaf78a20b87412557089", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: I finally saw them live and it was such an amazing experience! He was jamming out to one of their hits. Check out this epic picture of them!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-5e26257f548531ce069b19fa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.536086+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e26257f548531ce069b19fa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e26257f548531ce069b19fa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Cool, Dave! Seeing your favorite singers live must have been wild! Did you get a chance to hang out with them after the show?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-d558b71e0439b2de0983d650", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.551774+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d558b71e0439b2de0983d650", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d558b71e0439b2de0983d650", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Nah, didn't get to hang with them after the show, but seeing them live was cool enough. It's always a dream to see your favorites performing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-b4ada97f09fb48cfb4fa6ba8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.569849+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b4ada97f09fb48cfb4fa6ba8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b4ada97f09fb48cfb4fa6ba8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, it's always a dream to see your favorites doing their thing! So glad you got to experience that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-30552597eafd6fe52755bc55", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.585106+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "30552597eafd6fe52755bc55", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "30552597eafd6fe52755bc55", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Yeah, it was an incredible experience. So, anything new happening in your life?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-6c0f8324f6b468387bf146e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.587680+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6c0f8324f6b468387bf146e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6c0f8324f6b468387bf146e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Got a new ride and wrote some new tunes - had a few studio sessions last week and I'm excited to collaborate. Can't wait to share it with everyone!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-395a4f4742fd0d1e4fd6bd90", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.611666+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "395a4f4742fd0d1e4fd6bd90", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "395a4f4742fd0d1e4fd6bd90", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Cool, Calvin! Looking forward to hearing your new tunes. Keep me updated on how your collaborations go!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-51cd22e22da91a324e19c1d5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.627110+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "51cd22e22da91a324e19c1d5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "51cd22e22da91a324e19c1d5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, no worries! I'll definitely let you know how it goes. Cheers!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-b2007e03a6f585cda9f3fbd8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.644708+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b2007e03a6f585cda9f3fbd8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b2007e03a6f585cda9f3fbd8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Enjoy the collaborations, Calvin! Stay safe!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-17bd3812a11a4f6b0da61984", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.656317+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "17bd3812a11a4f6b0da61984", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "17bd3812a11a4f6b0da61984", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! Gonna have fun and stay safe with it. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-50/session_2-a414dfd2735e1cc0061779c0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T11:07:40.669486+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a414dfd2735e1cc0061779c0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a414dfd2735e1cc0061779c0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
